CompareThreads and compositionMode have no control anywhere in the UI and
were undiscoverable. The keys that do have one are listed alongside them,
since disparPDFc takes an INI file and there was nothing to write it from.

Every default was checked against the code. Note that
InitialComparisonMode defaults to CompareWords, not appearance — batch
mode is the one that falls back to appearance.

